", "title": "Migration and settlement"}], "description": "Students learn major demographic, regional, and historical patterns."}, {"id": "1b37ec82-8956-4849-b00f-a80a67bc14f2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Heritage language development", "children": [{"id": "0db134db-e9aa-4289-b9f7-5e682f142e7f", "type": "concept", "title": "Input and exposure"}, {"id": "3aec50d8-90e0-4f54-bb25-4d0cda23c7dc", "type": "concept", "title": "Literacy development"}, {"id": "888b7cec-c0ac-4fb1-a150-413795b08082", "type": "concept", "title": "Register range"}, {"id": "c5a862b6-0e16-4091-bd65-0516fc53dbd4", "type": "concept", "title": "Maintenance and shift"}], "description": "This subtopic examines Spanish learned and used in family, community, school, and workplace settings."}, {"id": "8e7ee655-8cd0-4efa-9ac7-92c9341890f7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Education and policy", "children": [{"id": "2e491d6f-291c-4f09-b710-54090505da33", "type": "concept", "title": "Bilingual education"}, {"id": "112ae7ae-4779-466a-b51b-1825104c1261", "type": "concept", "title": "Heritage language pedagogy"}, {"id": "6f217feb-ad00-4d8a-8005-ad8914e5705a", "type": "concept", "title": "Language rights"}, {"id": "c3a17dbb-f01a-4fa6-98a6-f173a41c0ec0", "type": "concept", "title": "Public discourse about Spanish"}], "description": "Students connect linguistics to schools and public life."}]}, {"id": "b31115e0-33e2-458b-819c-603bc5325209", "type": "topic", "title": "Corpus, Field, and Data Methods", "description": "Students learn how linguists collect, organize, analyze, and present Spanish-language evidence.", "children": [{"id": "27b6add6-8a69-45f5-95ee-e296f8c5d8b7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Corpus methods", "children": [{"id": "97cb80f8-aeeb-4ae2-86ca-b3bda1f3b3ec", "type": "concept", "title": "Search design"}, {"id": "f178a2bb-c3af-478d-8b68-8ee2edafe4ab", "type": "concept", "title": "Frequency"}, {"id": "bbfa079b-6483-49da-aaa5-6eeee0ffd585", "type": "concept", "title": "Concordance lines"}, {"id": "cf